        "sendTo": "={{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Thanks for your feedback on {{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.course }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1b1a17; max-width: 560px;\">\n  <p>Hi {{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.firstName }},</p>\n  <p>Thank you for your feedback! Your response has been received successfully.</p>\n  <p>Here's a copy of what you sent us about <strong>{{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.course }}</strong>:</p>\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%; border-top: 1px solid #ddd8cc; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd8cc; margin: 16px 0;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 12px 0; color: #7a746a; width: 120px; vertical-align: top;\">Rating</td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 12px 0;\"><strong>{{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.rating }} / 5</strong></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 12px 0; color: #7a746a; vertical-align: top; border-top: 1px solid #eee9df;\">Comments</td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee9df;\">{{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.messageHtml }}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  {{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.rating <= 2\n    ? '<p>We\\'re sorry the course didn\\'t work for you. Your course lead has been flagged and will be in touch within two working days to hear more.</p>'\n    : '<p>Glad to hear it went well. Your comments go straight to the course lead for the next intake.</p>' }}\n  <p style=\"color: #7a746a; font-size: 13px;\">Reference: {{ $('Validate & Clean Data').item.json.reference }}</p>\n  <p>Harbourline Academy</p>\n</div>",
